  innermost matrices in output satisfy matrix equations `
  sum_k matrix[..., i, k] * output[..., k, j] = rhs[..., i, j]`.
  If `adjoint` is `False` then the
  innermost matrices in output satisfy matrix equations
  `sum_k adjoint(matrix[..., i, k]) * output[..., k, j] = rhs[..., i, j]`.

